{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "a41d0d4704aec638a97cfc0f7158305601dca68b944e4353437048332a7a041c", "ja": "私が、そうしたいから", "zh": "因为我想这么做", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "146aecf9f6d26a0d2d78824fb2db49ca347c0f1f1ffc8dd919697c4f5047f04d", "ja": "「皆で繋ぐ公演だから、一緒がいいのか？」\nと尋ねるプロデューサーに、環は「たまきが\nそうしたいから！」と答える。素直な言葉に\n「自分もそうだった」と気付く歌織。八幕へ\n向け、育、ジュリアと共に稽古を開始する。", "zh": "面对制作人“因为是大家连结在一起的演出，所以想在一起吗？”的询问，环回答道“因为环想这么做！”。率真的话语让歌织意识到“自己曾经也是这样”。为了第八幕，她与育、茱莉亚一同开始了排练。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fb8e1623e00503d10211b9726bc45c21fe20ee375c31915f75d7f7dc28bf8a7c", "ja": "（批判されるかもしれない、そんな舞台に立つ。\nその理由を、誰かのせいにはしたくない）", "zh": "（明知道可能会受到批评，却还是要站上那样的舞台。我不想把这么做的理由归咎于别人。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8faacc70e02d82dbad127a70cdcf32355122b709e448c3d2c49a7eb9d752d468", "ja": "（自分の思いを、自分の言葉で言いたい。\n歌織さんは、そんなふうに言っていた。なら……）", "zh": "（我想用自己的话，说出自己的想法。\n歌织小姐就是这么说的。那么……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "28f2f8ede9d322dde9f0909f39e1a66deb3266ab23ab3b85131d9ea308c28159", "ja": "ねえねえ、おやぶん！　歌のレッスン、\n育とじゅりあも呼んでいい？", "zh": "喂喂，老大！歌唱课可以叫上育和朱莉娅吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4b483ea75a44f415265eb80237cfcf056c34b4d0a1694f486b4e2acb9b36ce8f", "ja": "もちろん、ふたりがいいって言ったらな。\nでも環、その前にひとつ聞いてもいいか？", "zh": "当然可以，只要她们俩同意就行。\n不过环，在那之前我能先问你一件事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "c2df3238dd8ed19c59d2edc577eea059165d621b911b1d54b60166566a214b5c", "ja": "？　なに？", "zh": "？什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "61d67ccb7e87c147fae3934d7e3f45b6b3e7cfaf780e73b573b633e49d10d0d4", "ja": "環は、『STARDOM ROAD』公演が\nみんなで繋ぐ公演だから……。", "zh": "因为环觉得，《STARDOM ROAD》公演是要由大家携手连接起来的公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1006_p", "source_sha256": "6d099c352a4afe260b8e09bd7dc5038a88971f7e7474d0c9bbb8b65cf90f0b28", "ja": "だから、一緒がいいって思うのか？", "zh": "所以，你觉得大家一起才好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "77f2baa69ca24d68064a21fc33820d9c4bc1fba6909fbf973c4ec288976df549", "ja": "{$P$}さん……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "43cef08e6fdeadb2b03859989d9f7afa992c866a26db2884d7c4bd47e9e8f4c6", "ja": "んー？　えっと、たまき、歌は\nみんなで歌ったほうが楽しいって思うし……。", "zh": "嗯——？那个，环觉得，\n唱歌还是大家一起唱更开心嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "b70217e5279df63cfda907c7c71660fb435f596641062f0d8e2b54a6cf4aa84a", "ja": "あとは……そうしたいから！　たまきが！", "zh": "还有……因为环想这么做！都是环自己想的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1010_052kao", "source_sha256": "5e1f433683c1478d6f6ed8fd8c2cee8f17858c8d2cf4313d535976ac8c1a49d8", "ja": "！　そう……。\n環ちゃんが、そうしたいの？", "zh": "！这样啊……环，是你想这么做吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "8682f7c80b1bf39b14343c2a4e7d7b257c5e076655a23c05791f38e6c4314ba9", "ja": "うん！　みんなで公演するのも、さっきの探検も。\nたまきがしたいから、してるんだぞ～！", "zh": "嗯！不管是和大家一起演出，还是刚才的探险，都是因为环想做，所以才去做的哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "7ca3db01321df40b78bf62c9541f5955c1465791761ee74e6506e86f68dec03c", "ja": "それで、みんなが楽しいって言ってくれたら、\nたまきもすっごくうれしい！　くふふ♪", "zh": "所以，如果大家都说很开心，\n环也会特别高兴！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1013_052kao", "source_sha256": "8df1c2896116da00493ec96da5fb8644b18f8483f2f348e11c1bd77dda18016b", "ja": "そう……そうよね。私も、同じなの……。\n私自身が、みんなと公演をしたいから……。", "zh": "对……对啊。我也是一样……因为我自己也想和大家一起演出……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "3f161d886e3c76a63f8959078baf7ecc7730573364e0357c91b48a7bd8cb6055", "ja": "かおり？", "zh": "歌织？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1015_052kao", "source_sha256": "9415b850e6f12052f3283ddd41b09b3072894dd980edf52fb3f42693fc491efc", "ja": "ここまでみんなが繋いできた公演を見て……\n繋ぎたいと思ったの。私が、そうしたいって。", "zh": "看着大家一路延续至今的公演……\n我也想把它延续下去。我想要这么做。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1016_052kao", "source_sha256": "6d598b4858ca62516ae1ac03bb17a4af12627d90fc79317fa6c73b553b4d46f5", "ja": "たった、それだけのことなのに。\nそれをこんなに悩んでたなんて……ふふっ。", "zh": "明明只是这么点小事，我却为此烦恼了这么久……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1017_052kao", "source_sha256": "bea4de73d158fa99ec260540afc4ea76fb3ef887d54775ca1e47958354d61d3a", "ja": "{$P$}さん。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55", "ja": "はい。", "zh": "是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1019_052kao", "source_sha256": "6c3d61d14d31ff3c9ab58ff3e02c61b0281dc2e10b8d1dacbbe72207dd7659c7", "ja": "私は、私がそうしたいと思ったことに、誠意をもって\n臨みます。……それしか、ありませんものね。", "zh": "我会真诚地面对自己想做的事。……毕竟，也只有这样了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1020_p", "source_sha256": "4597b3196a91401363465856d5d7c9444804dac27b5a5d0d597fbe343bb60973", "ja": "ええ。もちろん、全力でお手伝いしますよ！", "zh": "嗯。当然会竭尽全力帮助你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1021_052kao", "source_sha256": "3613a0ae39025f907c4a96f242460e52bb04332e8da02b7b648cca798d84768e", "ja": "小さい子には、教えられてばかりです。\n環ちゃん、探検させてくれてありがとう。", "zh": "我总是被小孩子们点醒呢。\n环，谢谢你带我一起探险。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1023_040tam", "source_sha256": "bb022fb5988b99238cbb1b19b0e46fc6bbde5d18b2cf376af5497571592ebc55", "ja": "あれっ？\n育とじゅりあがいる～！", "zh": "咦？\n育和茱莉亚也在～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "374d2ad7c8dbd72466a228e3ec94d9b000c983646dc70305e0d8e3ca1d2e98d0", "ja": "おっ、みんな集まっちゃったな。\nあたしは、ちょっと育にギターをせがまれてな。", "zh": "哦，大家都聚到一起了啊。刚才育一直缠着我，让我弹吉他来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1025_p", "source_sha256": "8af37718aaded5176698098e7a0fb01e1f921514ddb3f15ca00ab40a3ed9cf7c", "ja": "へえ、育ってギターに興味あったのか。", "zh": "原来育对吉他感兴趣啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1026_030iku", "source_sha256": "75a811b8707f2f7eaa7360c4b85adee3e72904d9344f16e8f533e2886b119ea6", "ja": "うん！　最近、アニメのオープニングを\n弾く動画とかよく見てるから。", "zh": "嗯！最近经常看弹奏动画片片头曲的视频。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1027_030iku", "source_sha256": "e92f3d4f09e26d0a4b4187a3b4c1738aa03d22cf277e149e70502e11a7b1a338", "ja": "かっこいいし、大人っぽいし……わたしもひけたら\nいいなって。でも、どうきがふじゅんだよね？", "zh": "又帅气，又成熟……我也想要是能弹就好了。可是，我的动机不纯对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "180450eac7d9c203c20ea76033b90865f1ae6cfbb733cda5440a226d5dbea9eb", "ja": "なに言ってんだ。ギターなんて『カッコいい！』と\n『モテたい！』で始めるやつが9割だぞ？", "zh": "你在说什么呢。开始学吉他的人，有9成都是因为“好帅！”和“想受欢迎！”吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1029_030iku", "source_sha256": "d0a336de9c36a74cc16066420d1d8a4acb6e9dc1dfc1ba69932f91359bb2f73a", "ja": "えーっ。\nジュリアさん、それ、本当？", "zh": "诶——\n茱莉亚先生，那是真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1030_050jul", "source_sha256": "62502949694f96d5bca46685e0e97c844e5c1e08e7d284efec411ac6f3ab1f8e", "ja": "本当だね、断言してもいい。\nそれに、動機なんてなんだっていいと思うけどな。", "zh": "确实如此，我可以断言。\n而且我觉得，动机是什么都无所谓吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "a389181f0d6b609d725820d5d787cdca30dd6168750ef0d0fea981a110206cd4", "ja": "自分がそうしたいって思ったら、\n始める理由なんてそれで十分なんだ。", "zh": "只要自己想做，那就是开始的充分理由了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1032_050jul", "source_sha256": "64c102aaf8198de1df4020fc3b9f675b25625f6a04120385a4988d7b2b003096", "ja": "{$P$}、カオリも\nそう思うだろ？", "zh": "{$P$}，歌织也这么想吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1033_052kao", "source_sha256": "ea0bd1fb318c59d190ee9ffc737d7fb8246d1591dc4350d9957b7edf077d91d0", "ja": "……ええ、本当に。\nジュリアちゃんの言う通りね。", "zh": "……嗯，确实如此。\n正如茱莉亚所说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1034_050jul", "source_sha256": "43f64c01bdeaa75b62ad7261ab8ead039706d25f83fc3af4b29c98bc8151cb16", "ja": "？　カオリ、やけにいい顔してるけど……\n何かあったのか？", "zh": "？　香织，你的表情特别好看……发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1035_052kao", "source_sha256": "1200e3b59f4730e433b247844557c3d6d164d4a102e17cca89d5d3517ad3c498", "ja": "ええ。とっても、素敵なことがあったの。\n……ふふっ。", "zh": "是的。发生了一件非常美好的事。\n……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1036_040tam", "source_sha256": "989d730a742eee2f6770067f999a12ed9c948f1459f08368529d7dddcb31f3b8", "ja": "じゅりあ！　ギター、たまきもやってみたーい！\nギターの穴って、なんか虫かごみたいだし。", "zh": "朱莉娅！玉也想试试弹吉他——！\n吉他的音孔感觉就像虫笼一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1037_050jul", "source_sha256": "38be3083a4e8b84fa34a3e347b2a2d63501572b60db68b76cb3ab87b775fb1e4", "ja": "む、虫かごにされるのはちょっと困るな……。\nそれよりみんな、レッスンしに来たんじゃないのか？", "zh": "当、当作虫笼我可有点吃不消啊……\n比起这个，大家不是来参加课程练习的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0365_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0365_story_03_1038_050jul", "source_sha256": "e8cdfc89da92de603532939e981d7a76d4780140f518d46d4578653e33af55bf", "ja": "なら、ギターの話は終わった後にして、\n始めようぜ！", "zh": "那吉他的话题就等结束后再聊，开始吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
